+ * as motor time. A write whose peak reaches HAP_DEV_FLOOR keeps the ERM motor running for the write's
+ * length, at least HAP_DEV_MIN ms (a tap), plus HAP_DEV_AHEAD ms so a long waveform renews it every
+ * other write. The peak sets the drive: HAP_DEV_LOW_MV at the floor up to full VMAX at full scale.
